# ============================================================
# LOAD BALANCER ENGINE — SUPPORT DOCUMENT
# ============================================================
# This engine distributes tasks across modules based on current
# load values. It ensures optimal resource utilization.
#
# RESPONSIBILITIES:
#   - Track module load
#   - Select lowest-load module
#   - Maintain load history
#
# Used by:
#   - Job Scheduling Engine
#   - Pipeline Execution Engine
#   - Orchestrator
